OL,15,     Fmotorbike on a roundabout and a
OL,16,     Fmiddle-lane hogger tests positive
OL,17,     Ffor cocaine, while an uninsured
OL,18,     Fdriver is suspected of
OL,19,     Fdrink-driving.
